    {
      "build": 12,
      "date": "2026-11-20",
      "bench": false,
      "notes": "K-line + CAN bridge firmware 383 and dash screen 0.1.1. The screens now play a boot video with the car's name (2.1 and 2.8C; pick the name on the Display page), and the brightness slider no longer snaps back to 5 %. A screen on 0.1.0 needs a Fresh install once, for the boot video's space. The bridge takes firmware updates over Bluetooth from R53 Logger, and in the screen build passes the screen's updates through from the phone. Update keeps your settings.",
